        "value": "<h2>Printed Statblock</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d8+3 (7 hp)</p><p><strong>Initiative:</strong> +3</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 30 ft. dwarves,</p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 15 (+3 Agy, +2 leather), touch 13, flat-footed 12</p><p><strong>Base Attack/Grapple:</strong> +1/+2 enemies.</p><p><strong>Attack:</strong> Spear +2 melee (1d8+1/x3) or javelin +5 ranged (1d6+1)</p><p><strong>Full Attack:</strong> Spear +2 melee (1d8+1/x3) or javelin +5 ranged (1d6+1)</p><p><strong>Space/Reach:</strong> 5 ft./5 ft.</p><p><strong>Special Attacks:</strong> -</p><p><strong>Special Qualities:</strong> Low-light vision, cold subtype, improved rapid healing, ice troll traits</p><p><strong>Saves:</strong> Fort +5, Ref +5, Will +0</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Str 13, Agy 16, Sta 16, Int 10, Spt 10, Cha 6</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Balance +5, Jump +5, Stealth +9, Survival +4</p><p><strong>Feats:</strong> Skilled (Jump and Stealth)</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> Dun Morogh, Zul&#039;Drak</p><p><strong>Organization:</strong> Team (3-6), group (6-12), or raiding party (2-8 ice trolls, 1-4 3rd-level spellcasters, and one 8th-level leader)</p><p><strong>Advancement:</strong> By character class</p><p><strong>Level Adjustment:</strong> Use racial levels</p><p><strong>Manual boundary:</strong> situational targeting, tactical decisions, and exceptional special abilities remain GM-adjudicated unless an embedded item provides a roll or effect.</p>"
